  bb-dtm-bb-polohopis-a-vyskopis-bodoveho-pola: "ngsi-ld: not ingestible (T-4324 deletes it): 240636 Point features in S-JTSK (EPSG:5514): NGSI-LD locations are WGS 84 and no pipeline step reprojects"
